{"4891230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead Stop - The Tenant", "steam_appid": 4891230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead Stop is an anthology of short horror games - an episodic experience inspired by classic horror stories. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Tenant is second episode.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jonathan had spent months chasing listings that vanished overnight, landlords who never called back, and rents that seemed designed to keep people like him out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, at last, he found it: a modest apartment in an old building, cheap enough to afford and decent enough to call home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the first time in years, Jonathan felt like life was finally giving him a break. He had a set of keys in his pocket, a roof over his head, and the chance to start over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But some places are cheap for a reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And life had other plans for its newest tenant...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891230/extras/b74c4885fc923b6039eab2590178d4c4.poster.avif?t=1786630488\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891230/extras/b74c4885fc923b6039eab2590178d4c4.webm?t=1786630488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891230/extras/b74c4885fc923b6039eab2590178d4c4.mp4?t=1786630488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One apartment. One landlord. Something already inside.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles built around domestic routines and a disturbing rental history</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story told through messages, objects, tapes, and things that should not be there</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow-burn apartment horror with surreal reality shifts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short and complete. No filler, no padding</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead Stop is an anthology of short horror games - an episodic experience inspired by classic horror stories. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Tenant is second episode.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jonathan had spent months chasing listings that vanished overnight, landlords who never called back, and rents that seemed designed to keep people like him out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, at last, he found it: a modest apartment in an old building, cheap enough to afford and decent enough to call home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the first time in years, Jonathan felt like life was finally giving him a break. He had a set of keys in his pocket, a roof over his head, and the chance to start over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But some places are cheap for a reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And life had other plans for its newest tenant...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891230/extras/b74c4885fc923b6039eab2590178d4c4.poster.avif?t=1786630488\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891230/extras/b74c4885fc923b6039eab2590178d4c4.webm?t=1786630488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891230/extras/b74c4885fc923b6039eab2590178d4c4.mp4?t=1786630488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One apartment. One landlord. Something 